{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015E2bMzkjjzTEFWxBKVSoQE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'best档叙事中，2×2矩阵(Qwen×LLaMA × SciERC×CoNLL)已充分，exp-017是最后一块拼图且结果\n2\t  高度positive。exp-011作为P2 OOD实验提供Claim 3的domain-shift boundary evidence，预期弱但 不影响核心acceptance。Reviewer接受informal-domain\n3\t  degradation作为acknowledged limitation。\n4\t\n5\t  '\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: ner_ood_robustness\n8\t  plan_id: exp-011\n9\t  description: 'SciERC fine-tuned Qwen3-8B在WNUT-17 test set上做zero-shot NER inference\n10\t    (N=8, T=1.0, seed=42)。Entity type schema不匹配（科学实体→social media实体）， 测试structural\n11\t    consistency signals在domain shift下的robustness。\n12\t\n13\t    '\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    n_instances: 1287\n16\t    n_gold_empty_filtered: 598\n17\t    n_valid: 689\n18\t    n_conditional: 378\n19\t    sample_f1_pct_zero: 61.4\n20\t    greedy_f1: 0.143\n21\t    oracle_f1: 0.302\n22\t    oracle_headroom: 0.159\n23\t    full:\n24\t      SJ_rho: 0.078\n25\t      FK_rho: 0.064\n26\t      logprob_rho: -0.031\n27\t      EM_rho: 0.051\n28\t      voting_conf_rho: 0.093\n29\t      SJ_AUROC: 0.562\n30\t      FK_AUROC: 0.548\n31\t      logprob_AUROC: 0.487\n32\t      EM_AUROC: 0.539\n33\t      voting_conf_AUROC: 0.574\n34\t      SJ_tau: 0.054\n35\t      FK_tau: 0.044\n36\t      logprob_tau: -0.021\n37\t    conditional:\n38\t      SJ_rho: 0.198\n39\t      FK_rho: 0.152\n40\t      logprob_rho: 0.117\n41\t      EM_rho: 0.141\n42\t      voting_conf_rho: 0.224\n43\t      SJ_AUROC: 0.618\n44\t      FK_AUROC: 0.594\n45\t      logprob_AUROC: 0.573\n46\t      EM_AUROC: 0.587\n47\t      voting_conf_AUROC: 0.631\n48\t    structural_beats_logprob_full: true\n49\t    structural_beats_logprob_cond: true\n50\t    relative_ordering_preserved: true\n51\t    selection_f1:\n52\t      greedy: 0.143\n53\t      sj: 0.131\n54\t      logprob: 0.128\n55\t      voting_conf: 0.134\n56\t      random: 0.119\n57\t      oracle: 0.302\n58\t  result_rationale: 'OOD实验的核心逻辑：SciERC模型在WNUT-17上的entity schema完全不匹配（Task/Method/Material/Metric\n59\t    vs person/location/corporation/creative-work），导致greedy F1从in-domain 0.66暴跌至0.14，\n60\t    61%+实例产生F1=0。但在best档下，关键观察是：\n61\t\n62\t    (1) 绝对ρ极弱（full SJ 0.078）但并非zero——模型虽然不认识target entities，当它偶尔 做对时，structural consistency仍能区分好坏。这与exp-003\n63\t    matched-model结果（SJ ρ=0.082） 高度一致，说明WNUT-17本身就是一个consistency信号的hard domain。\n64\t\n65\t    (2) 信号相对排序保持不变：voting_conf > SJ > FK > EM > logprob。logprob甚至变负 （ρ=-0.031），因为OOD下模型calibration完全失效——它对不认识的entities给出confidently\n66\t    wrong的logprob。structural signals因为measure inter-sample agreement而非model confidence，\n67\t    在calibration崩溃时仍然informative。\n68\t\n69\t    (3) 条件集（排除F1=0）提升到SJ 0.198/voting 0.224——pattern与所有in-domain实验一致， 但绝对值仍弱。\n70\t\n71\t    (4) logprob反转为负值是一个有趣的finding：支撑Claim 1的narrative——在model calibration 不可靠的场景（OOD、closed-source\n72\t    APIs），structural signals是唯一可用的quality estimator。\n73\t\n74\t    (5) Best档reviewer视此为Limitations中的known boundary。论文一句话mention：\"On cross-domain\n75\t    OOD transfer, all signals degrade substantially but structural signals retain\n76\t    relative advantage\"即可。不需要作为main result。\n77\t\n78\t    '\n79\t  tables:\n80\t  - name: 'Table A.X (Appendix): OOD Quality Estimation — SciERC→WNUT-17'\n81\t    columns:\n82\t    - signal\n83\t    - ρ_full\n84\t    - ρ_cond\n85\t    - AUROC_full\n86\t    - AUROC_cond\n87\t    rows:\n88\t    - - voting_conf\n89\t      - 0.093\n90\t      - 0.224\n91\t      - 0.574\n92\t      - 0.631\n93\t    - - SJ\n94\t      - 0.078\n95\t      - 0.198\n96\t      - 0.562\n97\t      - 0.618\n98\t    - - FK\n99\t      - 0.064\n100\t      - 0.152\n101\t      - 0.548\n102\t      - 0.594\n103\t    - - EM\n104\t      - 0.051\n105\t      - 0.141\n106\t      - 0.539\n107\t      - 0.587\n108\t    - - logprob\n109\t      - -0.031\n110\t      - 0.117\n111\t      - 0.487\n112\t      - 0.573\n113\t  figures_description:\n114\t  - 'Appendix figure: grouped bar chart with 5 signals × 2 conditions (in-domain SciERC\n115\t    vs OOD WNUT-17)。ρ值从左到右下降但柱形颜色排序不变。Logprob柱形在OOD条件下跌入 negative区域用红色标注，visual emphasis\n116\t    on calibration failure。\n117\t\n118\t    '\n119\t  analysis: '此实验为P2，在best档叙事中属于Limitations/Discussion material。核心价值是两点： (a) relative\n120\t    ordering preservation证明structural consistency不是dataset-specific artifact； (b)\n121\t    logprob负相关提供了一个clean argument for structural signals在uncalibrated scenarios 下的unique\n122\t    value。但绝对效果太弱（全部ρ<0.25），不适合写入main results。建议放Appendix table + Limitations段落1-2句。在best档下reviewer不会因为缺少更多OOD\n123\t    experiments而reject， 因为2×2 in-domain矩阵已充分。\n124\t\n125\t    '\n126\t- name: ner_llama_conll\n127\t  plan_id: exp-017\n128\t  description: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B fine-tuned on CoNLL-2003 (LoRA), NER inference N=8 T=1.0\n129\t    seed=42 + N=16 3-seed (42/123/456) robustness。完成2×2 cross-model×cross-dataset矩阵的\n130\t    第四格(LLaMA×CoNLL)。\n131\t\n132\t    '\n133\t  expected_results:\n134\t    dataset: CoNLL-2003\n135\t    model: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct\n136\t    n_instances: 3453\n137\t    n_valid: 2756\n138\t    n_conditional: 2642\n139\t    N8:\n140\t      greedy_f1: 0.927\n141\t      oracle_f1: 0.944\n142\t      oracle_headroom: 0.018\n143\t      full:\n144\t        SJ_rho: 0.431\n145\t        FK_rho: 0.428\n146\t        logprob_rho: 0.307\n147\t        EM_rho: 0.431\n148\t        voting_conf_rho: 0.426\n149\t        SJ_AUROC: 0.704\n150\t        FK_AUROC: 0.703\n151\t        logprob_AUROC: 0.761\n152\t        EM_AUROC: 0.705\n153\t        voting_conf_AUROC: 0.709\n154\t        SJ_ECE: 0.114\n155\t        voting_conf_ECE: 0.095\n156\t      conditional:\n157\t        SJ_rho: 0.436\n158\t        FK_rho: 0.431\n159\t        logprob_rho: 0.328\n160\t        EM_rho: 0.44\n161\t        voting_conf_rho: 0.374\n162\t        SJ_AUROC: 0.723\n163\t        logprob_AUROC: 0.81\n164\t      SJ_vs_logprob_delta_rho: 0.124\n165\t      structural_beats_logprob: true\n166\t    N16_seed42:\n167\t      full:\n168\t        SJ_rho: 0.464\n169\t        FK_rho: 0.457\n170\t        logprob_rho: 0.306\n171\t        EM_rho: 0.461\n172\t        voting_conf_rho: 0.455\n173\t        SJ_AUROC: 0.739\n174\t      conditional:\n175\t        SJ_rho: 0.46\n176\t        FK_rho: 0.452\n177\t        logprob_rho: 0.319\n178\t      best_of_n:\n179\t        greedy: 0.924\n180\t        sj_best: 0.926\n181\t        logprob_best: 0.925\n182\t        voting_conf_best: 0.927\n183\t        oracle: 0.949\n184\t      n8_to_n16_SJ_delta: 0.033\n185\t    N16_seed123:\n186\t      full:\n187\t        SJ_rho: 0.47\n188\t        FK_rho: 0.459\n189\t        logprob_rho: 0.316\n190\t        EM_rho: 0.468\n191\t        voting_conf_rho: 0.461\n192\t        SJ_AUROC: 0.74\n193\t      conditional:\n194\t        SJ_rho: 0.471\n195\t        logprob_rho: 0.331\n196\t      best_of_n:\n197\t        greedy: 0.924\n198\t        sj_best: 0.925\n199\t        logprob_best: 0.925\n200\t        voting_conf_best: 0.926\n201\t        oracle: 0.949\n202\t    N16_seed456:\n203\t      full:\n204\t        SJ_rho: 0.455\n205\t        FK_rho: 0.448\n206\t        logprob_rho: 0.308\n207\t        EM_rho: 0.452\n208\t        voting_conf_rho: 0.457\n209\t        SJ_AUROC: 0.729\n210\t      conditional:\n211\t        SJ_rho: 0.451\n212\t        logprob_rho: 0.324\n213\t      best_of_n:\n214\t        greedy: 0.924\n215\t        sj_best: 0.924\n216\t        logprob_best: 0.924\n217\t        voting_conf_best: 0.924\n218\t        oracle: 0.949\n219\t    three_seed_aggregated:\n220\t      SJ_rho_mean: 0.463\n221\t      SJ_rho_std: 0.008\n222\t      FK_rho_mean: 0.455\n223\t      FK_rho_std: 0.006\n224\t      logprob_rho_mean: 0.31\n225\t      logprob_rho_std: 0.005\n226\t      EM_rho_mean: 0.46\n227\t      EM_rho_std: 0.008\n228\t      voting_conf_rho_mean: 0.458\n229\t      voting_conf_rho_std: 0.003\n230\t      structural_beats_logprob_rate: 1.0\n231\t      SJ_AUROC_mean: 0.736\n232\t      SJ_AUROC_std: 0.006\n233\t    cross_model_consistency:\n234\t      qwen_conll_SJ_rho: 0.436\n235\t      llama_conll_SJ_rho: 0.431\n236\t      delta: 0.005\n237\t      qwen_scierc_SJ_rho: 0.357\n238\t      llama_scierc_SJ_rho: 0.363\n239\t      delta_scierc: -0.006\n240\t  result_rationale: 'exp-017在best档下是decisive positive result，理由如下：\n241\t\n242\t    (1) Cross-model一致性极高：LLaMA CoNLL SJ ρ=0.431 vs Qwen CoNLL ρ=0.436 (Δ=0.005)。 两个architecturally不同的8B模型（Qwen3\n243\t    vs LLaMA-3.1）在同一数据集上产生几乎 相同的consistency-accuracy correlation。这不是trivial的——Qwen和LLaMA的tokenizer、\n244\t    pre-training data、architecture细节完全不同，但structural consistency作为quality estimator的有效性是一个关于output\n245\t    space agreement的property，与model internals无关。\n246\t\n247\t    (2) Cross-dataset一致性：LLaMA在SciERC上SJ ρ=0.363，在CoNLL上0.431。Qwen在SciERC上 0.357，CoNLL上0.436。两个模型都展示相同的dataset\n248\t    effect（CoNLL > SciERC），进一步 确认consistency signal strength是task property而非model\n249\t    artifact。\n250\t\n251\t    (3) logprob在CoNLL上的AUROC(0.761)高于structural signals(0.704)——这是CoNLL特殊性造成的： greedy\n252\t    F1=0.927极高，logprob calibration在near-perfect performance regime下更准确。 但ρ仍然显著低于structural（0.307\n253\t    vs 0.431，Δ=0.124），因为ρ测量的是rank discrimination 而非threshold classification。这个AUROC\n254\t    vs ρ的分离恰好为论文的metrics discussion提供 了一个自然的例子：不同metrics capture不同aspects of quality\n255\t    estimation。\n256\t\n257\t    (4) 3-seed robustness (SJ ρ std=0.008) 是最tight的across所有configurations。CoNLL的 large\n258\t    test set (n=2756)提供了high statistical power，variance自然低。这让reviewer对 \"results stable\n259\t    across random seeds\"的claim完全信服。\n260\t\n261\t    (5) N=8→N=16提升(SJ +0.033)在所有3 seeds上一致，但absolute gain modest——因为N=8已经 near-saturation\n262\t    on CoNLL NER。这与SciERC pattern一致（NER saturates earlier than RE）， 支撑Claim 3的task-complexity\n263\t    boundary narrative。\n264\t\n265\t    (6) Best-of-N selection在CoNLL上trivial（所有signals在greedy±0.003内，oracle headroom\n266\t    仅0.018），reinforces Claim 2：当greedy已near-optimal时，selection无headroom可exploit。 这是correlation-selection\n267\t    gap的complementary evidence——gap不仅存在于consistency signals fail to select的场景，也存在于所有signals（including\n268\t    logprob）都无法超越greedy的场景。\n269\t\n270\t    '\n271\t  tables:\n272\t  - name: 'Table 2: 2×2 Cross-Model × Cross-Dataset NER Quality Estimation (N=8, ρ\n273\t      on full set)'\n274\t    columns:\n275\t    - Configuration\n276\t    - SJ\n277\t    - voting_conf\n278\t    - FK\n279\t    - EM\n280\t    - logprob\n281\t    - n\n282\t    rows:\n283\t    - - Qwen × SciERC\n284\t      - 0.357\n285\t      - 0.502\n286\t      - 0.265\n287\t      - 0.257\n288\t      - 0.14\n289\t      - 529\n290\t    - - Qwen × CoNLL\n291\t      - 0.436\n292\t      - 0.424\n293\t      - 0.4\n294\t      - 0.451\n295\t      - 0.316\n296\t      - 2756\n297\t    - - LLaMA × SciERC\n298\t      - 0.363\n299\t      - —\n300\t      - 0.327\n301\t      - —\n302\t      - 0.183\n303\t      - 529\n304\t    - - LLaMA × CoNLL\n305\t      - 0.431\n306\t      - 0.426\n307\t      - 0.428\n308\t      - 0.431\n309\t      - 0.307\n310\t      - 2756\n311\t    note: '所有4格structural > logprob。Cross-model delta ≤ 0.006 on same dataset。\n312\t\n313\t      '\n314\t  - name: 'Table 3: AUROC across 2×2 matrix (N=8)'\n315\t    columns:\n316\t    - Configuration\n317\t    - SJ\n318\t    - voting_conf\n319\t    - logprob\n320\t    - best_single\n321\t    rows:\n322\t    - - Qwen × SciERC\n323\t      - 0.666\n324\t      - 0.728\n325\t      - 0.559\n326\t      - voting 0.728\n327\t    - - Qwen × CoNLL\n328\t      - 0.801\n329\t      - 0.789\n330\t      - 0.753\n331\t      - SJ 0.801\n332\t    - - LLaMA × SciERC\n333\t      - 0.702\n334\t      - 0.718\n335\t      - 0.558\n336\t      - voting 0.718\n337\t    - - LLaMA × CoNLL\n338\t      - 0.704\n339\t      - 0.709\n340\t      - 0.761\n341\t      - logprob 0.761\n342\t    note: 'logprob仅在CoNLL AUROC上competitive（high-baseline regime）。ρ-based ranking\n343\t      一致favor structural signals。\n344\t\n345\t      '\n346\t  - name: 'Table 4: LLaMA × CoNLL N=16 3-Seed Robustness'\n347\t    columns:\n348\t    - Metric\n349\t    - seed42\n350\t    - seed123\n351\t    - seed456\n352\t    - mean±std\n353\t    rows:\n354\t    - - SJ ρ\n355\t      - 0.464\n356\t      - 0.47\n357\t      - 0.455\n358\t      - 0.463±0.008\n359\t    - - FK ρ\n360\t      - 0.457\n361\t      - 0.459\n362\t      - 0.448\n363\t      - 0.455±0.006\n364\t    - - logprob ρ\n365\t      - 0.306\n366\t      - 0.316\n367\t      - 0.308\n368\t      - 0.310±0.005\n369\t    - - voting_conf ρ\n370\t      - 0.455\n371\t      - 0.461\n372\t      - 0.457\n373\t      - 0.458±0.003\n374\t    - - SJ AUROC\n375\t      - 0.739\n376\t      - 0.74\n377\t      - 0.729\n378\t      - 0.736±0.006\n379\t  figures_description:\n380\t  - 'Figure 2 (论文正文): 2×2 heatmap，行=model (Qwen/LLaMA)，列=dataset (SciERC/CoNLL)。 每格显示SJ\n381\t    ρ值，颜色深浅编码0.30-0.47范围。格内小字标注Δ vs logprob。Visual message： 四格一致呈深色(structural strong)，logprob\n382\t    delta一致为正。\n383\t\n384\t    '\n385\t  - 'Figure 3 (论文正文): LLaMA×CoNLL 3-seed error bar plot。X轴=5种signals，Y轴=ρ。 每个signal\n386\t    3个点+mean bar+95% CI whisker。Structural signals (SJ/FK/EM/voting) cluster在0.43-0.47，logprob\n387\t    isolated在0.31。CI不重叠→statistically significant gap。\n388\t\n389\t    '\n390\t  - 'Figure A.Y (Appendix): N=8 vs N=16 delta ρ bar chart for LLaMA×CoNLL。 Structural\n391\t    signals gain +0.03，logprob flat (−0.001 to +0.009)。Shows structural signals benefit\n392\t    more from additional samples。\n393\t\n394\t    '\n395\t  analysis: 'exp-017在best档下完成三个关键narrative objectives：\n396\t\n397\t    (a) 2×2矩阵完整性：4格全部structural > logprob (cross_config_ner_structural_gt_logprob_rate\n398\t    = 1.0)，直接满足best档指标。Cross-model delta < 0.01证明model-agnostic。\n399\t\n400\t    (b) CoNLL的large n (2756)提供了SciERC(529)不具备的statistical power。Bootstrap CI更紧， Fisher\n401\t    z-test的power更高。Reviewer trust结果的confidence level显著提升。\n402\t\n403\t    (c) 3-seed std=0.008是所有configurations中最低的——seed instability不是concern。\n404\t\n405\t    在best档的paper presentation中，此实验应占据main results的~40%篇幅：Table 2 (2×2 matrix with\n406\t    ρ)是论文的central evidence table，Figure 2 (heatmap)是最impactful的visual。 3-seed robustness放Table\n407\t    4或Appendix。Best-of-N的trivial结果（greedy±0.003）用一句话 mention即可，不需要单独table——它reinforces\n408\t    Claim 2 but isn''t surprising on CoNLL。\n409\t\n410\t    logprob的AUROC anomaly (0.761 > SJ 0.704 on CoNLL)需要在paper中explicitly discuss：\n411\t    在near-perfect baseline regime下logprob是well-calibrated threshold classifier，但ρ\n412\t    reveals它的ranking ability仍然inferior。这个AUROC-ρ divergence本身是一个interesting methodological\n413\t    point，支撑论文使用multiple metrics的design choice。'\n414\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5f10f0e-4112-4acf-bcc8-7fa2b85fb642","uuid":"8528ae80-5539-46d1-8cf4-0335385dbe21","timestamp":"2026-05-14T21:17:41.287Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T203201/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'best档叙事中，2×2矩阵(Qwen×LLaMA × SciERC×CoNLL)已充分，exp-017是最后一块拼图且结果\n  高度positive。exp-011作为P2 OOD实验提供Claim 3的domain-shift boundary evidence，预期弱但 不影响核心acceptance。Reviewer接受informal-domain\n  degradation作为acknowledged limitation。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: ner_ood_robustness\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: 'SciERC fine-tuned Qwen3-8B在WNUT-17 test set上做zero-shot NER inference\n    (N=8, T=1.0, seed=42)。Entity type schema不匹配（科学实体→social media实体）， 测试structural\n    consistency signals在domain shift下的robustness。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances: 1287\n    n_gold_empty_filtered: 598\n    n_valid: 689\n    n_conditional: 378\n    sample_f1_pct_zero: 61.4\n    greedy_f1: 0.143\n    oracle_f1: 0.302\n    oracle_headroom: 0.159\n    full:\n      SJ_rho: 0.078\n      FK_rho: 0.064\n      logprob_rho: -0.031\n      EM_rho: 0.051\n      voting_conf_rho: 0.093\n      SJ_AUROC: 0.562\n      FK_AUROC: 0.548\n      logprob_AUROC: 0.487\n      EM_AUROC: 0.539\n      voting_conf_AUROC: 0.574\n      SJ_tau: 0.054\n      FK_tau: 0.044\n      logprob_tau: -0.021\n    conditional:\n      SJ_rho: 0.198\n      FK_rho: 0.152\n      logprob_rho: 0.117\n      EM_rho: 0.141\n      voting_conf_rho: 0.224\n      SJ_AUROC: 0.618\n      FK_AUROC: 0.594\n      logprob_AUROC: 0.573\n      EM_AUROC: 0.587\n      voting_conf_AUROC: 0.631\n    structural_beats_logprob_full: true\n    structural_beats_logprob_cond: true\n    relative_ordering_preserved: true\n    selection_f1:\n      greedy: 0.143\n      sj: 0.131\n      logprob: 0.128\n      voting_conf: 0.134\n      random: 0.119\n      oracle: 0.302\n  result_rationale: 'OOD实验的核心逻辑：SciERC模型在WNUT-17上的entity schema完全不匹配（Task/Method/Material/Metric\n    vs person/location/corporation/creative-work），导致greedy F1从in-domain 0.66暴跌至0.14，\n    61%+实例产生F1=0。但在best档下，关键观察是：\n\n    (1) 绝对ρ极弱（full SJ 0.078）但并非zero——模型虽然不认识target entities，当它偶尔 做对时，structural consistency仍能区分好坏。这与exp-003\n    matched-model结果（SJ ρ=0.082） 高度一致，说明WNUT-17本身就是一个consistency信号的hard domain。\n\n    (2) 信号相对排序保持不变：voting_conf > SJ > FK > EM > logprob。logprob甚至变负 （ρ=-0.031），因为OOD下模型calibration完全失效——它对不认识的entities给出confidently\n    wrong的logprob。structural signals因为measure inter-sample agreement而非model confidence，\n    在calibration崩溃时仍然informative。\n\n    (3) 条件集（排除F1=0）提升到SJ 0.198/voting 0.224——pattern与所有in-domain实验一致， 但绝对值仍弱。\n\n    (4) logprob反转为负值是一个有趣的finding：支撑Claim 1的narrative——在model calibration 不可靠的场景（OOD、closed-source\n    APIs），structural signals是唯一可用的quality estimator。\n\n    (5) Best档reviewer视此为Limitations中的known boundary。论文一句话mention：\"On cross-domain\n    OOD transfer, all signals degrade substantially but structural signals retain\n    relative advantage\"即可。不需要作为main result。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A.X (Appendix): OOD Quality Estimation — SciERC→WNUT-17'\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - ρ_full\n    - ρ_cond\n    - AUROC_full\n    - AUROC_cond\n    rows:\n    - - voting_conf\n      - 0.093\n      - 0.224\n      - 0.574\n      - 0.631\n    - - SJ\n      - 0.078\n      - 0.198\n      - 0.562\n      - 0.618\n    - - FK\n      - 0.064\n      - 0.152\n      - 0.548\n      - 0.594\n    - - EM\n      - 0.051\n      - 0.141\n      - 0.539\n      - 0.587\n    - - logprob\n      - -0.031\n      - 0.117\n      - 0.487\n      - 0.573\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix figure: grouped bar chart with 5 signals × 2 conditions (in-domain SciERC\n    vs OOD WNUT-17)。ρ值从左到右下降但柱形颜色排序不变。Logprob柱形在OOD条件下跌入 negative区域用红色标注，visual emphasis\n    on calibration failure。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '此实验为P2，在best档叙事中属于Limitations/Discussion material。核心价值是两点： (a) relative\n    ordering preservation证明structural consistency不是dataset-specific artifact； (b)\n    logprob负相关提供了一个clean argument for structural signals在uncalibrated scenarios 下的unique\n    value。但绝对效果太弱（全部ρ<0.25），不适合写入main results。建议放Appendix table + Limitations段落1-2句。在best档下reviewer不会因为缺少更多OOD\n    experiments而reject， 因为2×2 in-domain矩阵已充分。\n\n    '\n- name: ner_llama_conll\n  plan_id: exp-017\n  description: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B fine-tuned on CoNLL-2003 (LoRA), NER inference N=8 T=1.0\n    seed=42 + N=16 3-seed (42/123/456) robustness。完成2×2 cross-model×cross-dataset矩阵的\n    第四格(LLaMA×CoNLL)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dataset: CoNLL-2003\n    model: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct\n    n_instances: 3453\n    n_valid: 2756\n    n_conditional: 2642\n    N8:\n      greedy_f1: 0.927\n      oracle_f1: 0.944\n      oracle_headroom: 0.018\n      full:\n        SJ_rho: 0.431\n        FK_rho: 0.428\n        logprob_rho: 0.307\n        EM_rho: 0.431\n        voting_conf_rho: 0.426\n        SJ_AUROC: 0.704\n        FK_AUROC: 0.703\n        logprob_AUROC: 0.761\n        EM_AUROC: 0.705\n        voting_conf_AUROC: 0.709\n        SJ_ECE: 0.114\n        voting_conf_ECE: 0.095\n      conditional:\n        SJ_rho: 0.436\n        FK_rho: 0.431\n        logprob_rho: 0.328\n        EM_rho: 0.44\n        voting_conf_rho: 0.374\n        SJ_AUROC: 0.723\n        logprob_AUROC: 0.81\n      SJ_vs_logprob_delta_rho: 0.124\n      structural_beats_logprob: true\n    N16_seed42:\n      full:\n        SJ_rho: 0.464\n        FK_rho: 0.457\n        logprob_rho: 0.306\n        EM_rho: 0.461\n        voting_conf_rho: 0.455\n        SJ_AUROC: 0.739\n      conditional:\n        SJ_rho: 0.46\n        FK_rho: 0.452\n        logprob_rho: 0.319\n      best_of_n:\n        greedy: 0.924\n        sj_best: 0.926\n        logprob_best: 0.925\n        voting_conf_best: 0.927\n        oracle: 0.949\n      n8_to_n16_SJ_delta: 0.033\n    N16_seed123:\n      full:\n        SJ_rho: 0.47\n        FK_rho: 0.459\n        logprob_rho: 0.316\n        EM_rho: 0.468\n        voting_conf_rho: 0.461\n        SJ_AUROC: 0.74\n      conditional:\n        SJ_rho: 0.471\n        logprob_rho: 0.331\n      best_of_n:\n        greedy: 0.924\n        sj_best: 0.925\n        logprob_best: 0.925\n        voting_conf_best: 0.926\n        oracle: 0.949\n    N16_seed456:\n      full:\n        SJ_rho: 0.455\n        FK_rho: 0.448\n        logprob_rho: 0.308\n        EM_rho: 0.452\n        voting_conf_rho: 0.457\n        SJ_AUROC: 0.729\n      conditional:\n        SJ_rho: 0.451\n        logprob_rho: 0.324\n      best_of_n:\n        greedy: 0.924\n        sj_best: 0.924\n        logprob_best: 0.924\n        voting_conf_best: 0.924\n        oracle: 0.949\n    three_seed_aggregated:\n      SJ_rho_mean: 0.463\n      SJ_rho_std: 0.008\n      FK_rho_mean: 0.455\n      FK_rho_std: 0.006\n      logprob_rho_mean: 0.31\n      logprob_rho_std: 0.005\n      EM_rho_mean: 0.46\n      EM_rho_std: 0.008\n      voting_conf_rho_mean: 0.458\n      voting_conf_rho_std: 0.003\n      structural_beats_logprob_rate: 1.0\n      SJ_AUROC_mean: 0.736\n      SJ_AUROC_std: 0.006\n    cross_model_consistency:\n      qwen_conll_SJ_rho: 0.436\n      llama_conll_SJ_rho: 0.431\n      delta: 0.005\n      qwen_scierc_SJ_rho: 0.357\n      llama_scierc_SJ_rho: 0.363\n      delta_scierc: -0.006\n  result_rationale: 'exp-017在best档下是decisive positive result，理由如下：\n\n    (1) Cross-model一致性极高：LLaMA CoNLL SJ ρ=0.431 vs Qwen CoNLL ρ=0.436 (Δ=0.005)。 两个architecturally不同的8B模型（Qwen3\n    vs LLaMA-3.1）在同一数据集上产生几乎 相同的consistency-accuracy correlation。这不是trivial的——Qwen和LLaMA的tokenizer、\n    pre-training data、architecture细节完全不同，但structural consistency作为quality estimator的有效性是一个关于output\n    space agreement的property，与model internals无关。\n\n    (2) Cross-dataset一致性：LLaMA在SciERC上SJ ρ=0.363，在CoNLL上0.431。Qwen在SciERC上 0.357，CoNLL上0.436。两个模型都展示相同的dataset\n    effect（CoNLL > SciERC），进一步 确认consistency signal strength是task property而非model\n    artifact。\n\n    (3) logprob在CoNLL上的AUROC(0.761)高于structural signals(0.704)——这是CoNLL特殊性造成的： greedy\n    F1=0.927极高，logprob calibration在near-perfect performance regime下更准确。 但ρ仍然显著低于structural（0.307\n    vs 0.431，Δ=0.124），因为ρ测量的是rank discrimination 而非threshold classification。这个AUROC\n    vs ρ的分离恰好为论文的metrics discussion提供 了一个自然的例子：不同metrics capture不同aspects of quality\n    estimation。\n\n    (4) 3-seed robustness (SJ ρ std=0.008) 是最tight的across所有configurations。CoNLL的 large\n    test set (n=2756)提供了high statistical power，variance自然低。这让reviewer对 \"results stable\n    across random seeds\"的claim完全信服。\n\n    (5) N=8→N=16提升(SJ +0.033)在所有3 seeds上一致，但absolute gain modest——因为N=8已经 near-saturation\n    on CoNLL NER。这与SciERC pattern一致（NER saturates earlier than RE）， 支撑Claim 3的task-complexity\n    boundary narrative。\n\n    (6) Best-of-N selection在CoNLL上trivial（所有signals在greedy±0.003内，oracle headroom\n    仅0.018），reinforces Claim 2：当greedy已near-optimal时，selection无headroom可exploit。 这是correlation-selection\n    gap的complementary evidence——gap不仅存在于consistency signals fail to select的场景，也存在于所有signals（including\n    logprob）都无法超越greedy的场景。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: 2×2 Cross-Model × Cross-Dataset NER Quality Estimation (N=8, ρ\n      on full set)'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - SJ\n    - voting_conf\n    - FK\n    - EM\n    - logprob\n    - n\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen × SciERC\n      - 0.357\n      - 0.502\n      - 0.265\n      - 0.257\n      - 0.14\n      - 529\n    - - Qwen × CoNLL\n      - 0.436\n      - 0.424\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.451\n      - 0.316\n      - 2756\n    - - LLaMA × SciERC\n      - 0.363\n      - —\n      - 0.327\n      - —\n      - 0.183\n      - 529\n    - - LLaMA × CoNLL\n      - 0.431\n      - 0.426\n      - 0.428\n      - 0.431\n      - 0.307\n      - 2756\n    note: '所有4格structural > logprob。Cross-model delta ≤ 0.006 on same dataset。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table 3: AUROC across 2×2 matrix (N=8)'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - SJ\n    - voting_conf\n    - logprob\n    - best_single\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen × SciERC\n      - 0.666\n      - 0.728\n      - 0.559\n      - voting 0.728\n    - - Qwen × CoNLL\n      - 0.801\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.753\n      - SJ 0.801\n    - - LLaMA × SciERC\n      - 0.702\n      - 0.718\n      - 0.558\n      - voting 0.718\n    - - LLaMA × CoNLL\n      - 0.704\n      - 0.709\n      - 0.761\n      - logprob 0.761\n    note: 'logprob仅在CoNLL AUROC上competitive（high-baseline regime）。ρ-based ranking\n      一致favor structural signals。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table 4: LLaMA × CoNLL N=16 3-Seed Robustness'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - seed42\n    - seed123\n    - seed456\n    - mean±std\n    rows:\n    - - SJ ρ\n      - 0.464\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.455\n      - 0.463±0.008\n    - - FK ρ\n      - 0.457\n      - 0.459\n      - 0.448\n      - 0.455±0.006\n    - - logprob ρ\n      - 0.306\n      - 0.316\n      - 0.308\n      - 0.310±0.005\n    - - voting_conf ρ\n      - 0.455\n      - 0.461\n      - 0.457\n      - 0.458±0.003\n    - - SJ AUROC\n      - 0.739\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.729\n      - 0.736±0.006\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2 (论文正文): 2×2 heatmap，行=model (Qwen/LLaMA)，列=dataset (SciERC/CoNLL)。 每格显示SJ\n    ρ值，颜色深浅编码0.30-0.47范围。格内小字标注Δ vs logprob。Visual message： 四格一致呈深色(structural strong)，logprob\n    delta一致为正。\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 3 (论文正文): LLaMA×CoNLL 3-seed error bar plot。X轴=5种signals，Y轴=ρ。 每个signal\n    3个点+mean bar+95% CI whisker。Structural signals (SJ/FK/EM/voting) cluster在0.43-0.47，logprob\n    isolated在0.31。CI不重叠→statistically significant gap。\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure A.Y (Appendix): N=8 vs N=16 delta ρ bar chart for LLaMA×CoNLL。 Structural\n    signals gain +0.03，logprob flat (−0.001 to +0.009)。Shows structural signals benefit\n    more from additional samples。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-017在best档下完成三个关键narrative objectives：\n\n    (a) 2×2矩阵完整性：4格全部structural > logprob (cross_config_ner_structural_gt_logprob_rate\n    = 1.0)，直接满足best档指标。Cross-model delta < 0.01证明model-agnostic。\n\n    (b) CoNLL的large n (2756)提供了SciERC(529)不具备的statistical power。Bootstrap CI更紧， Fisher\n    z-test的power更高。Reviewer trust结果的confidence level显著提升。\n\n    (c) 3-seed std=0.008是所有configurations中最低的——seed instability不是concern。\n\n    在best档的paper presentation中，此实验应占据main results的~40%篇幅：Table 2 (2×2 matrix with\n    ρ)是论文的central evidence table，Figure 2 (heatmap)是最impactful的visual。 3-seed robustness放Table\n    4或Appendix。Best-of-N的trivial结果（greedy±0.003）用一句话 mention即可，不需要单独table——它reinforces\n    Claim 2 but isn''t surprising on CoNLL。\n\n    logprob的AUROC anomaly (0.761 > SJ 0.704 on CoNLL)需要在paper中explicitly discuss：\n    在near-perfect baseline regime下logprob是well-calibrated threshold classifier，但ρ\n    reveals它的ranking ability仍然inferior。这个AUROC-ρ divergence本身是一个interesting methodological\n    point，支撑论文使用multiple metrics的design choice。'\n","numLines":414,"startLine":1,"totalLines":414}}}
